        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium silicate, spray powder 80%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium silicate, spray powder 80%, at plant
data based on a EMPA study, commissioned by the CEES.;
CAS number: 001344-09-8; 
UUID: adbd72e3-e987-394d-bb23-0bfdc7a9af5f
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of sodium silicate spray powder. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. The input of compressed air is not reported in the data according to the methodology of the study.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology used from these European producers
Time period: producer information for production year 1995
Production volume: na
Sampling: sampling of questionnaires 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_adbd72e3-e987-394d-bb23-0bfdc7a9af5f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
